    "detailed_description": "<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034720/extras/6edb76ef61a3c72c503a3b6b1349ce41.poster.avif?t=1723568083\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034720/extras/6edb76ef61a3c72c503a3b6b1349ce41.webm?t=1723568083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034720/extras/6edb76ef61a3c72c503a3b6b1349ce41.mp4?t=1723568083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FULL VERSION IS AVAILAIBE ON STEAM</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034720/extras/f36ad133fcd24b666b51c7af1310483f.poster.avif?t=1723568083\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034720/extras/f36ad133fcd24b666b51c7af1310483f.webm?t=1723568083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034720/extras/f36ad133fcd24b666b51c7af1310483f.mp4?t=1723568083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><br>In Prologue you will be able to experience the limited version of &quot;Tavern Manager Simulator&quot;. Don't forget to add to your wishlist and follow us for the full version of the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Restore the Tavern</strong></h2>Take over an abandoned tavern in a fantasy kingdom and restore it to its former glory! Get rid of the trash and cobwebs, wipe off the dust, buy new furniture and decor, and furnish the place to your liking. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034720/extras/2537f375e8213f3e6752cac3d22c5e68.poster.avif?t=1723568083\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034720/extras/2537f375e8213f3e6752cac3d22c5e68.webm?t=1723568083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034720/extras/2537f375e8213f3e6752cac3d22c5e68.mp4?t=1723568083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Serve your customers</strong></h2>Fast and quality customer service is the key to your Tavern's prosperity. All customers expect their table to be filled with mugs of beer and appetizers at once, as if by magic. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034720/extras/3f78b258879f80c10d0bcb81f3d2f8a5.poster.avif?t=1723568083\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034720/extras/3f78b258879f80c10d0bcb81f3d2f8a5.webm?t=1723568083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034720/extras/3f78b258879f80c10d0bcb81f3d2f8a5.mp4?t=1723568083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Run your abandoned tavern in a fantasy kingdom<br></li><li>Renovate, improve, expand your establishment<br></li><li>Pour beer into huge mugs<br></li><li>Clean up, wash dishes<br></li><li>Visitors with different needs and expectations<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't forget to add the full version of &quot;Tavern Manager Simulator&quot; to your Wishlist.</strong></h2><br></li></ul>",
